<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><oois xmlns="http://www.outdooractive.com/api/"><tour id="9802279" type="5250" frontendtype="tour" ranking="84.0"><category id="1589846" name="Trails" iconUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconInactiveUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconMapUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconInactiveMapUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconTransparentUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/mountainbiking.geocontent.png" strokeColor="#ff0000" mapOverlays="mtb"><datatype>mountainbiking</datatype></category><title>SH 90 Huberalm-Trail am Westgipfel in Saalbach Hinterglemm</title><localizedTitle lang="en"><value>SH 90 Huberalm Trail at the West Peak in Saalbach Hinterglemm</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="fr"><value>SH 90 Huberalm-Trail au sommet ouest à Saalbach Hinterglemm</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="es"><value>SH 90 Huberalm-Trail en la cima oeste en Saalbach Hinterglemm</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="it"><value>SH 90 Huberalm-Trail am Westgipfel in Saalbach Hinterglemm</value></localizedTitle><shortText>&lt;p>Naturbelassener Singletrail mit Stein- und Wurzelpassagen in einer wunderbaren Naturkulisse. &lt;/p></shortText><longText>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Zurück zum Ursprung&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&#xd;
&lt;p>Der Huberalm Trail ist ein naturbelassener, teilweise etwas technischer Singletrail bis kurz oberhalb der Huber Grundalm. Von hier geht's über Forststraßen wieder zurück nach Hinterglemm.&lt;/p>&#xd;
&#xd;
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Dieser Trail ist unbeaufsichtigt und wird nicht permanent gewartet. Die Befahrung erfolgt auf eigene Gefahr. Entlang der Strecke gibt es keine besondere Gefahrensicherung. Aus diesem Grund erfolgt keine offizielle Angabe, ob der Trail geöffnet oder geschlossen ist. Auf sämtlichen durch den Tourismusverband und die Bergbahnen ausgewiesenen Mountainbike-Strecken gilt die Straßenverkehrsordnung (StVO)!&lt;/strong>&lt;/p></longText><primaryImage id="9802302"><author>Bernhard Niederseer</author></primaryImage><geometry>12.593603,47.342601,1697 12.593651,47.34269,1698 12.593561,47.342702,1694 12.593471,47.342689,1692 12.593383,47.342666,1689 12.593257,47.342628,1687 12.593187,47.3426,1686 12.593067,47.342539,1684 12.592908,47.342417,1683 12.592861,47.342353,1683 12.5928,47.342265,1682 12.59277,47.342195,1682 12.592697,47.34215,1680 12.592659,47.342112,1679 12.59266,47.342076,1679 12.592676,47.342017,1680 12.592743,47.34189,1682 12.592716,47.341761,1682 12.592634,47.341676,1680 12.592524,47.341565,1678 12.592453,47.341505,1677 12.592306,47.341416,1674 12.592221,47.341328,1673 12.592133,47.341251,1672 12.592085,47.34116,1671 12.592053,47.341109,1671 12.59201,47.341025,1670 12.591919,47.34097,1667 12.591872,47.340901,1666 12.591877,47.340788,1666 12.591848,47.340737,1665 12.591782,47.340635,1662 12.591765,47.340615,1661 12.591716,47.340601,1659 12.59164,47.34069,1658 12.591511,47.340867,1655 12.591492,47.340902,1654 12.591345,47.34094,1649 12.591267,47.340931,1647 12.591156,47.340904,1643 12.590886,47.340865,1633 12.590698,47.340861,1626 12.590415,47.340942,1614 12.59016,47.341027,1602 12.590059,47.341124,1597 12.590085,47.341244,1598 12.589974,47.34138,1593 12.5899,47.341568,1589 12.589688,47.341451,1579 12.589623,47.34152,1576 12.589576,47.341689,1574 12.589528,47.34182,1573 12.589442,47.341997,1570 12.589313,47.342085,1566 12.589231,47.342149,1563 12.589089,47.342226,1556 12.589084,47.342171,1556 12.589069,47.342089,1555 12.589017,47.342036,1551 12.588904